{"3036260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wylde Society", "steam_appid": 3036260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/011cd692eb793952d58ebafd168da993.poster.avif?t=1765310915\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/011cd692eb793952d58ebafd168da993.webm?t=1765310915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/011cd692eb793952d58ebafd168da993.mp4?t=1765310915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Venture Back in Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wylde Society takes place in the bustling town of Fairhaven at the turn of the century. Explore fashion, architecture, society rules and etiquette inspired by the recent past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run your own Magical Boarding House</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renovate and expand the Wylde family boarding house! Invite tenants and make them feel welcome during their stay. Some guests will only stay a season, but with your help, others may find a reason to stay for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/bbb880a27142264f3636da7cff965d24.poster.avif?t=1765310915\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/bbb880a27142264f3636da7cff965d24.webm?t=1765310915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/bbb880a27142264f3636da7cff965d24.mp4?t=1765310915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Host Splendid Parties</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an adept socialite, you will plan and host a range of fancy social events including tea parties, dinners, and balls. Choose the guest list, menu, seating plan and more. Will you whip up drama… or kindle some romance?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Beyond</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a time, séances were a popular affair, but telling a real mystic from a charlatan was tricky! Vivian has a true knack for contacting spirits. Whose spirits will you help with their unfinished business?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/d21d94b77b9f7ec69fa70d6818d33c64.poster.avif?t=1765310915\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/d21d94b77b9f7ec69fa70d6818d33c64.webm?t=1765310915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/d21d94b77b9f7ec69fa70d6818d33c64.mp4?t=1765310915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Befriend Magical Creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and collect charming familiars from cats to otters. These friendly companions have unique witchy talents, and love to keep you company (even on your broom)!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>More news on features to come!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/df8f4e97afd71cef032f0c0b3e5c82e8.avif?t=1765310915\" width=599 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/011cd692eb793952d58ebafd168da993.poster.avif?t=1765310915\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/011cd692eb793952d58ebafd168da993.webm?t=1765310915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/011cd692eb793952d58ebafd168da993.mp4?t=1765310915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Venture Back in Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wylde Society takes place in the bustling town of Fairhaven at the turn of the century. Explore fashion, architecture, society rules and etiquette inspired by the recent past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run your own Magical Boarding House</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renovate and expand the Wylde family boarding house! Invite tenants and make them feel welcome during their stay. Some guests will only stay a season, but with your help, others may find a reason to stay for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/bbb880a27142264f3636da7cff965d24.poster.avif?t=1765310915\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/bbb880a27142264f3636da7cff965d24.webm?t=1765310915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/bbb880a27142264f3636da7cff965d24.mp4?t=1765310915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Host Splendid Parties</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an adept socialite, you will plan and host a range of fancy social events including tea parties, dinners, and balls. Choose the guest list, menu, seating plan and more. Will you whip up drama… or kindle some romance?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Beyond</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a time, séances were a popular affair, but telling a real mystic from a charlatan was tricky! Vivian has a true knack for contacting spirits. Whose spirits will you help with their unfinished business?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/d21d94b77b9f7ec69fa70d6818d33c64.poster.avif?t=1765310915\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/d21d94b77b9f7ec69fa70d6818d33c64.webm?t=1765310915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/d21d94b77b9f7ec69fa70d6818d33c64.mp4?t=1765310915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Befriend Magical Creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and collect charming familiars from cats to otters. These friendly companions have unique witchy talents, and love to keep you company (even on your broom)!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>More news on features to come!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036260/extras/df8f4e97afd71cef032f0c0b3e5c82e8.avif?t=1765310915\" width=599 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Step into the elegant heels o